##  Core Engineering Artifact: Data Infrastructure & Impact Analytics Dashboard

### Operational Intelligence Architecture
To move the organization from fragmented paper/text-based logging to a data-driven paradigm, I architected and deployed a centralized data pipeline and analytics dashboard. This dashboard functions as a critical business intelligence (BI) tool, providing local government authorities and institutional donors with verifiable, audited impact metrics.

